致谢 / Acknowledgement

本项目（arcam）是「让她走出屏幕」AR 取景器（Let-her-step-out-of-the-screen-
and-into-your-world，https://filomenosnyder-stack.github.io/Let-her-step-out-
of-the-screen-and-into-your-world/）的透视投影 / 合成管线的独立移植实现：
投影、摆位、合成、抠图等算法按原版行为重新实现，未复制其源代码。原版取景器
的创意与界面设计归其作者所有，特此致谢。

Third-party components bundled in this repository retain their own licenses:
three.js and the MMD runtime files under `arcam/webui/mmd/` / `docs/mmd/`,
and the ISNet-anime ONNX model under `vendor/`, belong to their respective
authors and are redistributed here under their own terms.
